  "id": "estazolam",
  "term": "estazolam",
  "definition": "Estazolam is a triazolo-benzodiazepine drug with anxiety-reducing, anticonvulsant, sleep-inducing, and muscle-relaxing effects. It acts in the central nervous system by binding to a GABA receptor site separate from the main GABA binding site, which promotes chloride entry into neurons and lowers their excitability.",
